# Medieval Reconquered: this repository is PUBLIC, so it holds only our own
# work. The game itself (Medieval_TW.exe, data .txt files, Loc text, models,
# textures, sounds, video) is copyrighted and is never committed. The untouched
# game lives in ../MedievalOriginal and this folder is a working install.
#
# Exe changes are kept as patch scripts/descriptions under tools/ or patches/,
# never as a modified Medieval_TW.exe.

# 1) Ignore everything by default...
*
# ...but still look inside folders
!*/

# 2) Project files
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/skipcredits.txt

# 3) Our own work
!/analysis/**
!/tools/**
!/patches/**
!/docs/**

# 4) Never commit these, even inside the folders above
#    - full decompiler output of the copyrighted exe (kept locally as evidence)
/analysis/decompiled/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
#    - build output (compiled from our sources, rebuilt with patches/d3d9_proxy/build.py)
patches/**/build/
*.dll
